{"v":4,"catch":"日本高中生 Masakazu Tokimune 努力應對日常生活中幽默、陰謀和愛情的混合。","desc":"在不久的將來，各國將在科學研究方面投入鉅資，以解決糧食短缺問題。這導致了 119 世紀之後新元素的發現。東京科學家荒木彥十郎（Hikojuro Araki）創造了第256種元素Araraginium，能夠從虛無中產生生命。然而，在首次實驗期間，一場意想不到的事故使Araraginium散佈在東京各地。\n\n幾天后，一個奇怪的現象發生了：被推定死亡的人再次出現，保留了他們死亡前的記憶。他們被稱為 Araragi Humans，從事故發生到 72 小時前的時期內出現。\n\n這個故事在多年後的東京展開......","publisher":"REAL KYOTO","release":"2024-09-12","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 2.5GB / Switch 2.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8da69ce64a7e5eb2be87502e631d03d93afa50c4d08cd5da84f60e6fd547a3f2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c4bbba4af31c04d63d822ed9d143ae11b49a857fc646e7b5aabfeda7dccac5af.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b4d7915e8e8729d342a8a45cc2f572d30c228b667a304d057dc7169096a5edf8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/752136dbbe2693e316bd39cc3d621c0aa36b3191fdbaf18f5c83b7b4d3d444dd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ba46b4998c7950986b4b6bfbe8361c065082ca6e45ad7be5e33467172f131d4a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/641b65b64720342e7deb016d7121ebe54ca7531b83a82cf176a104ea505187ab.jpg"],"titleId":"01007c001ee0a000","dlc":[],"vids":["ADv1CKZhdLM"]}